Special-result speed vs normal (geometric mean): 1.53x before, 2.15x
after

(The geometric mean includes all functions in the benchmark. "unchanged"
means the medians differ by less than 10%.)

The denormal exp case only gets a bit faster, consistent with what
https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/issues/198276 measured for that
case.

